  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procurement Support for the African Food Systems Resilience Program for Burkina Faso</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The African Food System Resilience Program (FSRP) is a World Bank funded regional investment program aimed at strengthening the resilience of the food system in West Africa through a strategic regional approach. To support the programme UNOPS procures necessary motor vehicles, including trucks, a bus and various smaller vehicles.</narrative>
